```javascript
const tools = ["pencil", "ruler", "eraser"];
tools.push("glue");
console.log(tools[tools.length - 1]);
console.log(tools.length);
console.log(tools[0]);
```
Output:
```text
glue
4
pencil
```
The new item is last. The first three items keep their order.
